    "text": "Texas\nTexas Welcomes 33 New Game Wardens And Park Police Officers\nBy Danny Merrell,\n9 hours agoThe Texas Parks and Wildlife Department (TRWD) graduated the 67th Texas Game Warden and Texas State Parks Police cadet class on May 30 in Austin. The 28 game wardens and five state park police officers completed eight months of rigorous training and will soon begin their assignments at duty stations across the state.",
